window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Ruthless. Cunning. Gorgeous. Killers.</p> <p>They are the Kings of Bolten, an elite academy I have no business being in. My desire to remain invisible is dashed when I find myself bound to one of their enemies.</p> <p>Now, there’s no escape.</p> <p>With me in the crosshairs in a war between Kings and Lords at Bolten, will I be another victim or will the Kings spare me on the condition I belong to them?</p> <p>One thing is certain. I have a few dirty little secrets. Maybe I’m not the good girl everyone thought.</p> <p>Maybe I’m meant to be queen. Maybe… I’m meant to rule.</p> <p>Dirty Little Secrets is a mature mafia academy romance with three sinful Kings of Bolten. Please check out the foreword.</p>"; 
